  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Separated from Ren Zu and trapped in Ordinary Abyss, Boundless Forest Samsara cries herself to sleep daily. She wakes to a miniman no bigger than her finger, and her stirring throws him down. Curious, she stops crying and asks who he is, and he starts crying loudly. He says he had been his tribe’s tallest and proudest, until the mountain he climbed turned out to be a person, the first giant he had seen. The legend adds this shock meets almost anyone who explores and grows, and is why he wept at the sight of her.",
